The dataset consists of multi-hop question-answering tasks derived from Wikipedia, characterized by a strict two-entity reasoning structure where answers require synthesizing information across exactly two `gold_titles`. Each example is embedded within a high-density noise environment containing numerous topically relevant distractors, testing the model's ability to filter irrelevant context. Questions are syntactically complex and span diverse domains, demanding precise extractive identification of factual spans after resolving semantic ambiguities and logical links.

